1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,367
The all or none law.

2
00:00:01,367 --> 00:00:03,541
Below threshold, nothing.

3
00:00:03,541 --> 00:00:08,658
At or above it, an impulse of exactly the same size every time.

4
00:00:08,658 --> 00:00:14,518
A stronger stimulus does not make a bigger impulse; it makes more impulses per second.

